OL,3,GNEWSAMP 'concerned' MoD site could
OL,4,Abecome asylum seeker centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has asked the government to rule
OL,7,Fout the use of a Ministry of Defence
OL,8,F(MoD) site in Leicestershire as asylum
OL,9,Fseeker accommodation.
OL,11,FPeter Bedford, who represents Mid
OL,12,FLeicestershire, said he was concerned
OL,13,FMoD Garats Hay, in Woodhouse, could be
OL,14,Fused as an asylum centre similar to the
OL,15,Fone proposed on MoD land at Piddington
OL,16,Fin Oxfordshire.
OL,18,FBedford raised the issue in the House
OL,19,Fof Commons on Monday, highlighting
OL,20,Fsimilarities between the Piddington
OL,21,Fsite and Garats Hay, which was used to
OL,22,Fhouse Afghan refugees in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
