OL,3,GNEWSAMP 'concerned' MoD site could
OL,4,Abecome asylum seeker centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnna Turley, minister for border
OL,7,Fsecurity and asylum, said Bedford
OL,8,F"would be the first to know" if Garats
OL,9,FHay was being considered for such use.
